    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.128464,
      "compression_ratio": 1.636054,
      "end": 404.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 395.34,
      "text": "Now, according to Sullivan, Washington was watching closely to see to what extent Beijing provided economic or material support to Russia,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.072312,
      "compression_ratio": 1.681661,
      "end": 407.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 404.34,
      "text": "and would impose consequences if that occurred."
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.072312,
      "compression_ratio": 1.681661,
      "end": 408.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 407.34,
      "text": "He added, quote,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.072312,
      "compression_ratio": 1.681661,
      "end": 416.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 408.34,
      "text": "We will not allow that to go forward and allow there to be a lifeline to Russia from these economic sanctions from any country anywhere in the world."
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.072312,
      "compression_ratio": 1.681661,
      "end": 424.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 416.34,
      "text": "Meanwhile, Russia said on Sunday that it was counting on China to help it withstand the blow to its economy from Western sanctions."
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.072312,
      "compression_ratio": 1.681661,
      "end": 432.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 424.34,
      "text": "Western countries have imposed unprecedented sanctions on Russia's corporate and financial system since it invaded Ukraine on February 24th"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.049306,
      "compression_ratio": 1.539906,
      "end": 435.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 432.34,
      "text": "in what it calls a special military operation."
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.049306,
      "compression_ratio": 1.539906,
      "end": 443.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 435.34,
      "text": "Russia and China have tightened cooperation in recent times, as both have come under strong Western pressure over human rights and a raft of other issues."
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.049306,
      "compression_ratio": 1.539906,
      "end": 451.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 443.34,
      "text": "Beijing has not condemned Russia's attack on Ukraine and does not call it an invasion, but it has urged a negotiated solution."
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.077043,
      "compression_ratio": 1.388889,
      "end": 467.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 451.34,
      "text": "The White House issued a new warning to Russia today after waves of missiles struck a Ukrainian military facility less than 15 miles from the border with Poland, bringing the fighting ever closer to NATO's borders."
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.077043,
      "compression_ratio": 1.388889,
      "end": 470.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 467.34,
      "text": "Dozens of people were killed and more than 100 were wounded."
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.091226,
      "compression_ratio": 1.461538,
      "end": 473.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 470.34,
