      "compression_ratio": 1.461538,
      "end": 491.34,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 482.34,
      "text": "And among the war's casualties, American journalist Brent Renault, who was killed when Russian troops opened fire on his vehicle near Kyiv."
